msgid "Main changes"
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"We just released Quarkus 2.5.4.Final, a maintenance release for our 2.5 "
"release train containing bugfixes and documentation improvements."
msgstr ""

msgid "It is a safe upgrade for anyone already using 2.5."
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"If you are not using 2.5 already, please refer to the https://github.com/"
"quarkusio/quarkus/wiki/Migration-Guide-2.5[2.5 migration guide]."
msgstr ""

msgid "Jackson 2.12.6"
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"We upgraded to Jackson 2.12.6 to fix https://github.com/FasterXML/jackson-"
"databind/issues/3328[a security issue in Jackson Databind]."
msgstr ""

msgid "Platform resolution fix"
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"An issue has been fixed regarding how the platforms are resolved in the dev "
"tools.\n"
"This issue could cause code.quarkus.io do go out of memory when creating "
"projects with high number of extensions."
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"If you are running your own instance of https://github.com/quarkusio/code."
"quarkus.io[code.quarkus.io] internally,\n"
"you will want to update to this version to avoid issues."
msgstr ""

msgid "Full changelog"
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"You can get https://github.com/quarkusio/quarkus/releases/tag/2.5.4."
"Final[the full changelog of 2.5.4.Final on GitHub]."
msgstr ""

msgid "Come Join Us"
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"We value your feedback a lot so please report bugs, ask for improvements... "
"Let's build something great together!"
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"If you are a Quarkus user or just curious, don't be shy and join our "
"welcoming community:"
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"provide feedback on https://github.com/quarkusio/quarkus/issues[GitHub];"
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"craft some code and https://github.com/quarkusio/quarkus/pulls[push a PR];"
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"discuss with us on https://quarkusio.zulipchat.com/[Zulip] and on the https:/"
"/groups.google.com/d/forum/quarkus-dev[mailing list];"
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"ask your questions on https://stackoverflow.com/questions/tagged/"
"quarkus[Stack Overflow]."
msgstr ""
